t:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> › <a href=\"/sw/surah/69.html\">Sura Al-Haaqqa</a> › Aya 41</nav><h1>Tafsiri ya Sura Al-Haaqqa 69:41</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَمَا هُوَ بِقَوْلِ شَاعِرٍ قَلِيلًا مَّا تُؤْمِنُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Tafsiri ya maana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Wala si kauli ya mtunga mashairi. Ni machache sana mnayo yaamini.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Swahili Translation - Ali Mohsin Al-Barwani — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Maneno ya maimamu wawili yametolewa kwa Kiarabu asilia, neno kwa neno, pamoja na marejeo.</p><section><h2>Sheikh al-Islam Ibn Taymiyyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فنفى عنه أن يكون قول شاعر أو كاهن وهما من البشر.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 2/50</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=sw#s69a41\">Fungua katika tafsiri shirikishi (maandiko kamili)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/sw/ayah/69-40.html\">Aya iliyotangulia (69:40)</a><a href=\"/sw/ayah/69-44.html\">Aya inayofuata (69:44)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsiri ya Masheikh Wawili · <a href=\"/sw/\">Mwanzo</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Kuhusu mradi</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Faragha na masharti</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/69-44.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"sw\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsiri ya Al-Haaqqa 69:44 — kwa mujibu wa Ibn Taymiyyah na Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Na lau kama angeli tuzulia baadhi ya maneno tu,\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/69-44.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah